{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2022-01-18 07:00:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE ANNOUNCES COMMERCIAL RELEASE OF HIGH SENSITIVITY FLUORESCENT DETECTION STELLAR NIR / IR™ MODULES FOR JESS AUTOMATED WESTERN BLOTTING SYSTEM', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS, JAN. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT PROTEINSIMPLE, A BIO-TECHNE BRAND, RELEASED ITS STELLAR NIR / IR™ DETECTION MODULES FOR JESS.\xa0 STELLAR FLUORESCENCE MODULES ENABLE DETECTION OF LOW ABUNDANCE PROTEINS WHILE MULTIPLEXING MULTIPLE ANALYTES WITHIN THE SAME DETECTION LANE, SETTING A NEW INDUSTRY STANDARD FOR WESTERN BLOTTING FLUORESCENCE DETECTION SENSITIVITY.'}